{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Arcane Hat is a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be obtained as a reward from ",["l","吉尔","Gil"]," at the ",["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"]," after completing the ",["l","探险家公会","Monster Eradication Goal"]," of killing 100 ",["l","木乃伊","Mummies"],". After that, it can be purchased from ",["l","马龙","Marlon"]," for 20,000g."]]]],["Trivia",2,[["l",0,[[1,["This hat resembles the hat worn by the ",["l","法师","Wizard"],"."]]]]]]]}